<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns A-1 to Sony Europe Finance's programme.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns A-1 to Sony Europe Finance's programme.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's said on Friday that it had assigned an A-1 rating to Sony Europe Finance Plc's U.S. commercial paper programme, which benefits from a keepwell agreement from the parent firm Sony Corp.</p>
</text>
